			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1626973">
									

<p>So, let me see if I've got this straight. Every animal looks like Shia Labeouf and every animal weighs the same as Shia Labeouf when 1247 interacts with it no matter what it really weighs (so if he found a beached whale, he could grab it and pull it back out to sea?). The only way to tell the difference is to eat them, which is why he accidentally killed and cannibalized someone. Also, he can't see mushrooms.</p>
<p>I have so many questions. If Shia Labeouf lost an arm or got a full body tattoo, I assume all subsequent visualizations would also? When Shia wears makeup, do the visualizations? If he cut off the imaginary arm of a worm, does it still taste of worm? Also, why the hell Shia Labeouf?</p>
<p>Upvoted for good writing, covering the bases and WTF-ness.</p>

