																		Explanations
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ksaid" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1484103); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1484103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608541075" alt="ksaid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1484103)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ksaid" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1484103); return false;" >ksaid</a></span> <span class="odate time_1353849481 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">25 Nov 2012 13:18</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1627015">
									

<p>I have put an inordinate amount of thought into how this power works.</p>
<ul>
<li>You are exactly right about the whale thing. I went with a cow as it seemed a more reasonable test subject, but he could drag around a blue whale just as easily.</li>
<li>Not eat so much as to have it inside him. A bit of an unfair loophole, but I was deadset to make this guy chomp some Shias.</li>
<li>Glad the accidental cannibal thing came across, that was one of the few 'horror' elements I tried to get in. The interesting thing is, although he must've felt like a cannibal every time he ate meat, when he actually did cannibalize someone, he wouldn't have know, as he didn't recognise the taste.</li>
<li>I worry the mushroom thing seems tacked on, but it links in to the [REDACTED]s as a bit of a pseudo-explanation for the effects.</li>
<li>All visualisations (good word, might sub it in for 'instances') have Shia's scars, tattoos, and so on. I hadn't though of make-up, but I'll say yes. The effect stops somewhere between a coat of mud and clothing.</li>
<li>A cut off worm arm would disappear in his mouth.</li>
<li>I was inspired by a song about Shia Labeouf. It was a bit of a meme a while ago, which is why I'm a bit uncomfortable. If anyone has a better suggestion for a person to take his place, send 'em at me.</li>
</ul>
<p>Glad I managed to get you thinking!</p>

							</div>

								
					
